the LFB are, but hopefully they are creative-commons compatible.  We could
probably at least make a transitional lOjban document. Where you start in
english and as you introduce new concepts you apply them right away. like
maybe introduce grammar first, so use lojban placement using english words,
and just show how that would work.  and substitute in vocabulary words as
you see fit. I'm sure you've already thought of this. If you'd like to go
ahead with it, I'd  be happy to help .ui

